  "notes": [
    "Independent manual source audit of all six production TypeScript files, package metadata and manifest at the pinned commit. All 16 files beneath extensions/linux-node are partitioned into reviewed or excluded records; no production-source differences from the pin were present.",
    "Package openclaw.extensions names ./index.ts. Every local production import remains under extensions/linux-node; there is no external plugin-owned/shared shipped source boundary to include. command-utils.ts is consumed by commands.ts and location.ts, executables.ts by both command modules, location.ts by commands.ts, and config.ts by the entry and helpers. All are production source.",
    "Public SDK facade exports and package exports establish the five exact module identities. The local readFiniteNumber alias retains original SDK export identity asFiniteNumber; safeParseJson remains the public export name rather than SDK-internal tryParseJson.",
    "The register(api) parameter is proven by definePluginEntry options and OpenClawPluginDefinition.register to be OpenClawPluginApi. Its three consumed members are pluginConfig, registerNodeHostCommand and registerNodeInvokePolicy. No api.runtime or PluginRuntime handle is used.",
